Cell["\<\
We write H = H00 + eps H10 (can I write this as a function like H[0][1][T] or \
so? So H, X, z need to be 2x2 matrices of functions
FIRST ARGUMENT: eps
SECOND ARGUMENT: delta


no wait, H is just a function of X and z, we probably do not even have to \
write it explicitly(?) but can automatically expand? surely there is some \
good way to do this. Do it on paper first...\
\>", "Text",
